OL,3,GNEWSAZombie knife killer tells court
OL,4,Aco-accused were not involved in
OL,5,Astabbing
OL,6,
OL,7,FA drug dealer who stabbed a 17-year-old
OL,8,Fto death with a zombie knife has
OL,9,Fclaimed none of his co-accused were
OL,10,Finvolved.
OL,12,FTristan Kerr was attacked with a 13.5cm
OL,13,F(5.3in) blade in February by Georgie
OL,14,FMears, 19, and collapsed and died
OL,15,Foutside a house in Abertridwr,
OL,16,FCaerphilly county.
OL,18,FMears had gone to a flat on the same
OL,19,Froad to deliver two #25 bags of
OL,20,Fketamine to Kerr in February, where he
OL,21,Ftold Newport Crown Court Kerr tried to
OL,22,Fattack him.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
