OL,3,GNEWSAZombie knife killer tells court
OL,4,Aco-accused were not involved in
OL,5,Astabbing
OL,6,
OL,7,FMears, of Thornhill, Cardiff; Connor
OL,8,FPalfrey, 25, from Abertridwr; Ricardo
OL,9,FElliot, 27, of no fixed abode and Elexi
OL,10,FManny, 25, from Senghenydd, Caerphilly,
OL,11,Fdeny murder by joint enterprise.
